	measure 'Coste Personal Imputado Total 2026' = ```
			
			SUMX (
			    'Fact_Asignacion_RRHH',
			    
			    VAR Pct =
			        'Fact_Asignacion_RRHH'[PctDedicacion]
			
			    VAR CosteEmpleado =
			        COALESCE (
			            RELATED (
			                'Dim_RRHH'[COSTE TOTAL 2026 _PRORRATEADO DE SUBIDAS_ ALTAS Y BAJAS DURANTE EL AÑO__]
			            ),
			            0
			        )
			
			    RETURN
			        Pct * CosteEmpleado * [Escala Seleccionado]
			)
			```
		formatString: #,0.00\ "€";-#,0.00\ "€";#,0.00\ "€"
		lineageTag: 9faf2925-ba43-46e7-b282-afcbd6534bf0

